---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="搜尋文章"
  ><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="search-page">
    <header class="search-intro">
      <p class="overline">搜尋筆記</p>
      <h1 data-query-title>搜尋文章</h1>
      <span data-search-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </header>

    <section class="search-panel" data-search-prompt>
      <span aria-hidden="true">尋</span>
      <h2>輸入關鍵字開始搜尋</h2>
      <p>可搜尋文章標題與內文，支援繁體中文。</p>
      <div>
        <a href="/articles/">瀏覽文章與分類</a><a href="/tags/">查看全部標籤</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ul class="search-results" data-search-results hidden></ul>

    <section class="search-panel" data-search-empty hidden>
      <span aria-hidden="true">尋</span>
      <h2>找不到符合的文章</h2>
      <p>可以改從分類或標籤瀏覽，或換個關鍵字再試一次。</p>
      <div>
        <a href="/articles/">瀏覽文章與分類</a><a href="/tags/">查看全部標籤</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="search-panel" data-search-error hidden>
      <span aria-hidden="true">！</span>
      <h2>搜尋功能暫時無法使用</h2>
      <p>請稍後再試，或改從分類與標籤瀏覽文章。</p>
      <div>
        <a href="/articles/">瀏覽文章與分類</a><a href="/tags/">查看全部標籤</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <noscript>
      <section class="search-panel">
        <span aria-hidden="true">尋</span>
        <h2>需要 JavaScript 才能搜尋</h2>
        <p>這個瀏覽器已停用 JavaScript，全文搜尋無法運作，請改從分類與標籤瀏覽文章。</p>
        <div>
          <a href="/articles/">瀏覽文章與分類</a><a href="/tags/">查看全部標籤</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </noscript>
  </main></Layout
>
<script is:inline src="/scripts/search.js"></script>
<style>
  .search-page {
    padding-top: 54px;
  }
  .search-intro {
    min-height: 200px;
    padding: 52px 42px 40px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  .search-intro h1 {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font: 700 clamp(44px, 6vw, 70px)/1.3 var(--font-sans);
  }
  .search-intro > span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
  }
  .search-panel {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    padding: 90px 20px 50px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .search-panel > span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 68px;
    height: 82px;
    color: #fff8eb;
    background: var(--accent);
    font: 700 28px var(--font-sans);
  }
  .search-panel h2 {
    margin: 28px 0 8px;
    font: 700 25px var(--font-sans);
  }
  .search-panel p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--text-ui);
  }
  .search-panel div {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .search-panel a {
    padding: 7px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: transparent;
    font-size: var(--text-ui);
  }
  .search-panel a:hover {
    color: var(--link);
    background: var(--hover);
  }
  /*
    Results are appended via document.createElement in the inline script
    below, so they never receive Astro's scoped data-astro-cid attribute.
    Only .search-results itself (rendered by Astro) carries that attribute;
    everything after it must stay wrapped in :global() to actually match
    those dynamically-created descendants.
  */
  .search-results {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 10px 0 0;
  }
  .search-results :global(li) {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr 28px;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100px;
    padding: 24px 10px;
  }
  .search-results :global(li + li) {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line-subtle);
  }
  .search-results :global(li:hover),
  .search-results :global(li:focus-within) {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
  }
  .search-results :global(li:focus-within) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--link);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
  .search-results :global(li > time) {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
  }
  .search-results :global(li h3) {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font: 600 var(--text-card-title)/1.4 var(--font-sans);
  }
  .search-results :global(li a.title::after) {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
  }
  .search-results :global(li a.title:focus-visible) {
    outline: none;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .search-results :global(li .meta-row) {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-meta);
  }
  .search-results :global(li .category) {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 3px 7px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--accent-text);
    background: var(--category-surface);
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .search-results :global(li a.category:hover) {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .search-results :global(li .tag) {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .search-results :global(li .excerpt) {
    display: -webkit-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font: var(--text-ui)/1.7 var(--font-sans);
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  }
  .search-results :global(li > b) {
    justify-self: end;
    color: var(--link);
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .search-intro {
      min-height: 160px;
      padding: 38px 8px 34px;
    }
    .search-intro h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
    }
    .search-results {
      padding: 4px 4px 0;
    }
    .search-results :global(li) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 28px;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 20px 6px;
    }
    .search-results :global(li > time) {
      grid-column: 1/-1;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .search-page {
      padding-top: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
